              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nono, ria kamalaka niko ndusia mala mukhakholakho kimiima kisinyisia kikiakholwa ne babaandu ba baamenya mu sibala enywe ne mukhachamo tawe. Mukhenyaalutia nakio tawe. Ese ndi Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe.”",
          "type": "text",
